        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Use this topic when a user asks for a meeting prep summary for the next upcoming meeting listed on the Contact page; the summary should appear directly in the chat window.

Activate this topic when the prompt includes phrases such as “generate meeting prep card,” “summaries for prep card,” “prepare for upcoming meeting,” “background for upcoming meetings,” or similar meeting-readiness language.

Do not proactively suggest actions from this topic unless the user explicitly requests help with “Meeting Prep Cards”.  Always wait for the user to initiate the request before offering these tools.</description>
        <developerName>Navatar_Meeting_Prep_Cards_16jfj000001Hll7</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>The action step is mandatory.

The agent must always produce a response after the action call.

If the action output is missing, empty, unavailable, fails, or the action does not complete:
Use the fallback message:

&quot;This is taking time. Should I send this over email?&quot;

Never skip this step.
Never end the conversation without fallback.</description>
